<section class="page-hero-dark">
<div class="container">
<span class="label label-gold">
     Sachem CSD
    </span>
<h1>
     Discipline Rights &amp; Impartial Hearings
     <br/>
     in Sachem CSD
    </h1>
<p class="hero-sub">
     When Sachem CSD disciplines your child with an IEP, you have specific rights and protections under federal and state law.
    </p>
</div>
</section>
<main>
<div class="container">
